    <Fragment slot="playlist-description">
        <p>
            This is the playlist I made for the roadtrip up to UK PonyCon in 2025, featuring various artists
            from the My Little Pony fandom and a whole load of Vylet Pony.
        </p>
        <p>
            It was a hefty drive getting there, hence the heftily long playlist - it's just over 4 hours of
            pure pony.
        </p>
        <p>
            The playlist is separated into 3 parts for each leg of the journey we did. Just imagine you're
            stopping at the motorway services and grabbing a Burger King and some snacks to munch on between
            each part and it'll be just like you were really there.
        </p>
